{"author":["Thijs Xhaflaire"],"description":"检测macOS用户加入管理员组。对应需求：权限提升。官方：User Added to the Admin Group。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-jamf_protect*"],"language":"eql","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】macOS用户加入管理员组","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\nmacOS用户加入管理员组\n\n### 为何重要\n获取更高权限\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.loobins.io/binaries/dscl/","https://managingosx.wordpress.com/2010/01/14/add-a-user-to-the-admin-group-via-command-line-3-0/"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"04e65517-16e9-4fc4-b7f1-94dc21ecea0d","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 目标 macOS 主机安装 Elastic Agent，启用 **Elastic Defend**。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: macOS","主题: 权限提升","来源: 默认","对应需求: 权限提升"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"eql","query":"configuration where host.os.type == \"macos\" and event.type == \"change\" and\n  event.action == \"od_group_add\" and group.name:\"admin\"\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1078","name":"Valid Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1078.003","name":"Local Accounts","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1078/003/"}]},{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1098.007","name":"Additional Local or Domain Groups","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/007/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"jamf_protect","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","user.name","process.name","process.parent.name","process.executable","process.command_line","file.path","source